  "id": "wheelchair",
  "term": "wheelchair",
  "definition": "In this packet, a wheelchair refers specifically to an autonomous personal mobility system that carries users through self-directed navigation. It is described as a device for mobility that can be used by people with physical impairments as well as able-bodied users, and whose motion settings can affect perceived safety, convenience, and trust.",
